magic
tech OR1
<< metal1 >>
rect 0 56 25 60
rect 0 -1 25 3
<< metal2 >>
rect 2 30 6 36
rect 14 28 18 36
<< nwell >>
rect -3 35 28 62
<< labels >>
rlabel metal1 s 0 56 25 60 6 VDD
port 1 nsew power input
rlabel metal1 s 0 -1 25 3 6 VSS
port 2 nsew ground input
rlabel metal2 s 2 30 6 36 6 A
port 3 nsew signal input
rlabel metal2 s 14 28 18 36 6 Y
port 4 nsew signal output
<< properties >>
string FIXED_BBOX 0 0 25 60
string LEFclass CORE
string LEFsite unit
string LEFsymmetry X Y
string LEFview TRUE
<< end >>
